## Required vs Forbidden Libraries

| Purpose | MUST USE | MUST NOT USE |
|---------|----------|--------------|
| Outbound HTTP | `IRestfulClient`, `IRestfulRequest`, `IRestfulResponse`, `IRequestContext` | `HttpClient`, `IHttpClientFactory`, `RestSharp`, `Flurl` |
| Logging | `IKafkaLogger` | `Console.WriteLine`, `Debug.WriteLine`, `Trace.WriteLine`, `ILogger<T>` (unless wrapped), `Serilog`, `NLog` |
| MySQL | `IMySQLManager`, `IMySQLCommand` | raw `SqlConnection`, `SqlCommand`, `MySql.Data.MySqlClient`, `Dapper`, `EntityFramework`, `DbContext` |
| PostgreSQL | `IPostgreSQLManager`, `IDbPostgreSQLCommand` | raw `Npgsql`, `Dapper`, `EntityFramework` |
| Cassandra | `ICassandraManager`, `ICassandraSession` | raw driver |
| Redis | `IRedisManager`, `IRedisDB` | StackExchange.Redis direct |
| Config | `IECConfig.GetAppSettings<T>()` | `GetSection("AppSettings:...").Value` in Service/Controller |

Additional forbidden (unless explicitly requested):
`AutoMapper`, `MediatR`, `Polly`

