## Config Access Rules

```
// CORRECT — typed model via IECConfig in Provider/Infrastructure
_ecConfig.GetAppSettings<AppSettings>()

// WRONG — string path in Service or Controller
_ecConfig.GetSection("AppSettings:AI:Provider").Value
```

Preferred pattern:
1. Define fields in `{SolutionName}.Model/AppSettings` (inherit `DefaultAppSettings` when applicable)
2. Read once via `_ecConfig.GetAppSettings<AppSettings>()` in Infrastructure / Provider
3. Expose typed methods via interface consumed by Service

`GetSection(...)` is allowed **only** for framework/bootstrap/infrastructure concerns requiring dynamic section traversal.

