## Logging Format Rules

```csharp
// Correct
_logger.Log(LogLevel.Error, $"[{nameof(GetUser)}] user id not exist: {userId}");

// Wrong
Console.WriteLine("user not found");
```

- Include method name and key business identifier in every log message
- Log external API failures with request name and response code
- Log DB write failures with entity name and operation type
- Do NOT log full request payload if it may contain sensitive data

