## RestfulSettings Configuration

All `appsettings.{Environment}.json` files must contain a `RestfulSettings` section when using `IRestfulClient`:

```json
"RestfulSettings": {
  "Gateway": "http://192.168.55.60",
  "Settings": [
    {
      "Name": "GetTopics",
      "Method": "post",
      "Uri": "/memberservice/api/user/topics"
    }
  ]
}
```

Usage:
```csharp
RestfulRequest request = new RestfulRequest(_httpContextAccessor, _config);
request.CreateRequest("GetTopics");
return await _restfulClient.SendAsync<List<Topic>>(request);
```

